1
00:00:00,366 --> 00:00:01,000
I do.

2
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:03,833
I'll buy tickets and wait at the entrance.

3
00:00:07,766 --> 00:00:10,666
Seeing my art doesn't mean I forgive you.

4
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:16,333
I know. Just being here makes me so happy.

5
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,533
Since you're here, come on in.

6
00:00:21,766 --> 00:00:22,633
Can I look at them with you?

7
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,500
Sure. Stay behind the line, and don't touch my paintings.

8
00:00:29,566 --> 00:00:31,900
How have you been these past few months?

9
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:36,666
Pretty good. I sleep well, and no one traps me in my dreams.

10
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:41,200
I still love you. I was dying to see you.

11
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:44,066
But last time you couldn't let me go, you locked the door.

12
00:00:45,366 --> 00:00:48,000
That was my fault. You're scared of me, and I deserve it.

13
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,466
Three months, Ah Tan, before I dared to see you again.

14
00:00:51,866 --> 00:00:55,400
I'm sorry. I won't stop you, or push you to forgive me.

15
00:00:56,533 --> 00:00:59,933
This time, I want you to stand closer. Just this once.

16
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,300
Just a little closer.

17
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:04,333
Heartbeat... quiet down.

18
00:01:05,033 --> 00:01:06,166
Who said you could forgive me so soon?

19
00:01:07,033 --> 00:01:08,533
Okay. Whatever you say.

20
00:01:13,166 --> 00:01:13,966
Let's take it slow, okay?

21
00:01:14,566 --> 00:01:16,666
No more lies. And never lock me up again.

22
00:01:18,233 --> 00:01:20,366
Okay. I'm in no rush. I'll wait for your call.

23
00:01:23,633 --> 00:01:26,633
Then in two weeks at 3 PM, Rongwan Coast. Wait for me.

24
00:01:27,333 --> 00:01:27,866
Okay. I'll wait for you.

25
00:01:29,333 --> 00:01:31,833
Sorry, I can't finish my drafts. I can't make it today.
